					item: {
						components: {
							"minecraft:writable_book_content": {
								pages: [
									{
										raw: "as hope looks lost , you might be able to reach another horizon , but no one knows........\n\nThe cure exists only in the spaces between heartbeats, a silent frequency that realigns what the shadow-born contagion has unraveled. "
									}
									{
										raw: "It is a restoration of light found within the deepest resonance of the earth, mending the fractured spirit without demanding a price of self. To heal is to finally remember the sun."
