						components: {
							"minecraft:writable_book_content": {
								pages: [
									{
										raw: "The sky fractured, spilling an endless, velvet void that sought to drink the stars. It was the Great Unmaking, a silence so heavy it crushed the marrow. Yet, by the oldest law—the one written before light—I stood. I surrendered my name to the dark,"
